{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-633979266136080946 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=633979266085683762&sectionId=633979266136080946)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","label":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","default":"The Photos You Almost Deleted Could Become Your Favorite Keepsakes"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_altLeft","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_altLeft","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_altRight","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_altRight","default":"Describes the appearance of the image"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_titleLeft","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_titleLeft","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_titleRight","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_titleRight","default":"Title"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_rightImageLabel","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_rightImageLabel","default":"After"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_leftImageLabel","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_leftImageLabel","default":"Before"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_imageLeft_src","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_imageLeft_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/2grumpy.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOmSKr3siS_imageRight_src","label":"ggOmSKr3siS_imageRight_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/1grumpy.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","label":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","default":"<p>How many photographs are sitting on your phone right now that you have never looked at again?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe there is a blurry picture from a family dinner, a funny photo where everyone is making strange faces, an imperfect vacation shot, or an old picture that seemed unimportant when you took it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You might have even considered deleting some of them.</p><p>But sometimes, those are the photographs that become the most meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A perfect photograph can be beautiful, but an imperfect photograph can hold a story. It can remind you of a person, a place, a feeling, or a moment that you might otherwise forget.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of deleting those unexpected memories, consider turning one into a keepsake you can build and display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","label":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","default":"Not Every Great Memory Comes From a Perfect Photo"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","label":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","default":"<p>We often think the best photographs are the ones with perfect lighting, perfect poses, and carefully planned backgrounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But real memories rarely happen that way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone might blink. A child might move. Someone might make a ridiculous face. The background might be messy. The photograph might not be perfectly centered.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And yet, years later, those imperfections might be exactly what makes the photograph special.</p><p>The picture does not have to be perfect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It just needs to remind you of something you care about.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","label":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","default":"The Photos We Almost Delete Often Have the Best Stories"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","label":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","default":"<p>Think about the photographs you have saved over the years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There might be hundreds of carefully posed pictures, but there may also be a few random photographs that instantly make you laugh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it was taken during a spontaneous road trip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe your child was making a hilarious face.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe your pet did something unexpected.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe everyone was laughing so hard that nobody was looking at the camera.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These photographs may not win a photography competition, but they can hold memories that no perfectly staged photograph could recreate.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGXZ7YumrL_text","label":"ggGXZ7YumrL_text","default":"<p>A perfectly posed photograph shows you what people looked like.</p><p>A candid photograph can show you <strong>how a moment felt</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can see genuine laughter, excitement, surprise, silliness, or affection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That emotional connection is what can make an ordinary photograph worth keeping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Years from now, you may not remember exactly what happened that day. But seeing that photograph can bring the feeling back almost instantly.</p><p>That is the real value of a keepsake.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6DeOkdcmM_text","label":"gg6DeOkdcmM_text","default":"<p>Instead of leaving an old photograph buried in your phone, you can turn it into something physical.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick transforms your chosen photograph into a personalized brick mosaic that you can build piece by piece.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The photograph becomes more than an image stored digitally. It becomes something you can interact with, display, and enjoy in your home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And because you build the mosaic yourself, the process creates another memory connected to the original photograph.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzVz3his-x_text","label":"ggzVz3his-x_text","default":"<p>Some of the best photographs are the ones that make everyone laugh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A child covered in cake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family member caught making a ridiculous expression.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A pet sitting somewhere it definitely should not be.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A friend making everyone laugh during a trip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These pictures may not look traditional or elegant, but they can capture personalities and moments that you never want to forget.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turning one into a Memobrick can make that funny memory part of your home.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","label":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","default":"Family Photos Do Not Have to Be Perfect"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","label":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","default":"<p>Family photographs are often expected to look polished.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But some of the most treasured family memories are messy, spontaneous, and completely unplanned.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe everyone was laughing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe the children refused to sit still.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe the family pet jumped into the picture.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe someone was making a face in the background.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those imperfections can make the photograph feel more authentic.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A Memobrick can turn one of those moments into a unique family keepsake that tells a story every time someone sees it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","label":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","default":"<p>Travel photographs are another great example.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You may have beautiful pictures of famous landmarks, but sometimes the photograph that means the most is the random one taken along the way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It could be a picture from a roadside stop, a funny moment at the hotel, a group photo after getting lost, or a spontaneous snapshot during an adventure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The destination might be easy to remember.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The little moments along the way are often what make the trip unforgettable.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdIuDnwZ9w_text","label":"ggdIuDnwZ9w_text","default":"Even Your Pet's Funniest Photos Deserve a Place"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkv4KFMlhf_text","label":"ggkv4KFMlhf_text","default":"<p>Pet owners know that the best pictures are rarely planned.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your dog might be sleeping in a strange position.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your cat might be sitting inside a box.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your pet might be making an expression that looks completely ridiculous.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those moments become part of the personality you love about them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A funny or meaningful pet photograph can become a personalized Memobrick that gives that memory a permanent place in your home.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNndk3vKMw_text","label":"ggNndk3vKMw_text","default":"A Personalized Gift They Would Never Expect"},{"type":"html","id":"ggh_Gh02rOD_text","label":"ggh_Gh02rOD_text","default":"<p>One of the best things about this idea is that you can choose a photograph the recipient may have completely forgotten about.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imagine giving a parent a Memobrick made from an old family photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or giving a friend a mosaic made from a hilarious picture from a trip years ago.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or surprising your partner with a photograph from an ordinary day that you still remember fondly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The recipient may not remember the photograph immediately.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But once they see it, the story behind it can come rushing back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That surprise can make the gift even more meaningful.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/8aa69329-9b4e-4efb-869c-652159ff454c.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_alt","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_title","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggd3WMYMpqJ_text","label":"ggd3WMYMpqJ_text","default":"Build the Memory Together"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtxixnXXNT_text","label":"ggtxixnXXNT_text","default":"<p>Memobrick can turn an old photograph into a new shared experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of simply handing someone a finished decoration, you can build it together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Family members can sort the pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Friends can work on it during a weekend gathering.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents and children can build a favorite family photograph together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While you build, you can talk about the original memory and everything that happened that day.</p><p>The photograph preserves the old memory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The building process creates a new one.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWh1dxZsXo_text","label":"ggWh1dxZsXo_text","default":"Choosing the Right Size for Your Forgotten Photo"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZaTUIotZm_text","label":"ggZaTUIotZm_text","default":"<p>Once you find the photograph you want to preserve, the next step is choosing the right size.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A close up photograph with one person can work well with a smaller size because the main subject already takes up much of the image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If your forgotten photograph contains several people, pets, vehicles, or lots of background details, consider choosing a larger size.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For detailed photographs, larger sizes such as <strong>20x20, 30x20, or 40x30</strong> can provide more space for the important elements of the image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For cars and motorcycles especially, we recommend <strong>30x20 or 40x30</strong> because the additional space can help preserve recognizable details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKVdqDtXpK_text","label":"ggKVdqDtXpK_text","default":"Go Through Your Camera Roll Again"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAMXQ_e-xO_text","label":"ggAMXQ_e-xO_text","default":"<p>Now might be a good time to open your phone and scroll through those old photographs.</p><p>Do not only look for the clearest image.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Look for the photograph that makes you stop.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The one that makes you laugh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The one that reminds you of someone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The one that takes you back to a particular day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The one you almost deleted but somehow kept.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That might be the photograph worth turning into a keepsake.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4-G5CajDm_text","label":"gg4-G5CajDm_text","default":"<p>The photographs we almost delete can sometimes become the memories we treasure the most.</p><p>They may be blurry, silly, spontaneous, or completely unplanned. But behind every imperfect photograph is a moment that happened only once.</p><p>Instead of letting those memories disappear into your camera roll, give one of them a second life.</p><p>Turn it into something you can build, display, and share with the people who were there.</p><p><strong>Because the photo you almost deleted today might be the memory you are most grateful to have tomorrow.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsewHDVlBH_text","label":"ggsewHDVlBH_text","default":"Honest Customer Review"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4yeexijwg_text","label":"gg4yeexijwg_text","default":"<p>Adam L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Adam_L._This_was_the_best_valentine_s_gift_for_my_wife._We_enjoyed_putting_it_together._We_liked_it_so_much_we_sent_one_to_my_sister_of_her_dog_and_she_absolutely_loved_it._Thank_you.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_alt","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyE1w8i7SH_title","label":"ggyE1w8i7SH_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxB6ooWVM8_text","label":"ggxB6ooWVM8_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;This was the best valentine's gift for my wife. &nbsp;We enjoyed putting it together. We liked it so much we sent one to my sister of her dog and she absolutely loved it. Thank you!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg11d2AJjwb_text","label":"gg11d2AJjwb_text","default":"<p>Denise A</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Denise_A._This_experience_was_wonderful_and_at_first_I_couldn_t_see_it_but_when_you_step_and_admire_it_you_can_the_photo_clearly..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_alt","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpygXuvYBQ_title","label":"ggpygXuvYBQ_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggznD6R8LqM_text","label":"ggznD6R8LqM_text","default":"<p>This experience was wonderful and at first I couldn’t see it, but when you step and admire it you can the photo clearly.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqznJ2mLCK_text","label":"ggqznJ2mLCK_text","default":"<p>Hilary S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Hilary_S._Super_easy_to_put_together._Comes_with_a_tool_to_use._But_I_placed_them_all_1_by_1._Reminded_me_alot_of_doing_diamond_art_pictures..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_alt","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl-Gy2dreT_title","label":"ggl-Gy2dreT_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMvyoU_XQU_text","label":"ggMvyoU_XQU_text","default":"<p>Super easy to put together. Comes with a tool to use. But I placed them all 1 by 1. Reminded me a lot of doing diamond art pictures.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiBfS11Yku_text","label":"ggiBfS11Yku_text","default":"<p>Lindsay W.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Lindsay_W._This_was_a_Christmas_present_for_my_husband_we_had_so_much_fun_putting_it_together_together._He_loved_the_end_result.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_alt","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_alt","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_title","label":"ggTK6ZZ_JvU_title","default":"Customized Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMVg08QRSg_text","label":"ggMVg08QRSg_text","default":"<p>This was a Christmas present for my husband, we had so much fun putting it together, together. He loved the end result!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","label":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","default":"<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is Memobrick a good gift for car enthusiasts?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","default":"<p>Can I use a photo of their actual car?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","default":"<p>Can I use a photo of a classic or dream car?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","default":"<p>Is it only for birthdays?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","label":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","default":"<p>Yes. It allows you to turn their favorite vehicle into a personalized brick mosaic they can build and display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLojdV256l_text","label":"ggLojdV256l_text","default":"<p>Absolutely. In fact, a photograph of their own vehicle can make the gift much more personal than a generic car themed present.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","label":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","default":"<p>Yes. If the photograph has personal meaning to the recipient, it can make a great Memobrick.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","label":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","default":"<p>Not at all. A car themed Memobrick can be given for birthdays, holidays, anniversaries, Father's Day, milestones, or simply as a surprise.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","label":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPuZQwARXK_text","label":"ggPuZQwARXK_text","default":"<p>Hurry up! Sale <span style=\"color:#EA3335;\">20%</span>. Sale ends in:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_dayLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_hourLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_hourLabel","default":"Hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_minuteLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_minuteLabel","default":"Mins"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_secondLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_secondLabel","default":"Secs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoC_glJwG_weekLabel","label":"ggcoC_glJwG_weekLabel","default":"Weeks"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_0","label":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_0","default":"<p>Personalized Just for You</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_1","label":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_1","default":"<p>A Fun Building Experience</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_2","label":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_2","default":"<p>A Lasting Keepsake</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_3","label":"gg5gIaiaVz6_childItem_3","default":"<p>Supports strength increases bone</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdgnvah2s